The Developer shall have the following duties, in addition to other duties that the corporate authority of the City of Metropolis deem necessary and proper:

(A) To attract, secure and encourage industries and commercial businesses to locate in or near Metropolis, Illinois;

(B) To plan or develop the Industrial Park in the City of Metropolis;

(C) To assist existing commercial businesses and industries in expanding and retaining their operations;

(D) To analyze economic development opportunities and develop specific recommendations for economic growth; and

(E) To work closely with the Mayor and Industrial Committee in accomplishing these duties.

